    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">This consignment bilty is issued by the Indian Bulk and Allied (IBA) transport authority and serves as a transport contract. It must be stamped, signed by the consignor, and include details such as vehicle number, destination, and transport mode.</p>
